{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/minimumScaleFactor","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The minimum permissible proportion to shrink the font size to fit the text into the available space."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumScaleFactor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"}],"role":"symbol","title":"minimumScaleFactor","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV18minimumScaleFactorSdvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumScaleFactor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"set"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the example below, a label with a "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/minimumScaleFactor","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of 0.5 draws its text in a font size as small as half of the actual font if needed to fit into the space next to the text input field:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HStack {"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Text(“This is a very long label:”)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":".lineLimit(1)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":".minimumScaleFactor(0.5)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TextField(“My Long Text Field”, text: $myTextField)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":".frame(width: 250, height: 50, alignment: .center)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"}"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"You can set the minimum scale factor to any value greater than 0 and less than or equal to 1."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default value is 1."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI uses this value to shrink text that doesn’t fit in a view when it’s okay to shrink the text."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, a label with a "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/minimumScaleFactor","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of 0.5 draws its text in a font size as small as half the actual font if needed."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/minimumscalefactor"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Environment":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environment","title":"Environment","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A property wrapper that reads a value from a view’s environment.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/minimumScaleFact